{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"show","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES to show alerts in foreground, NO to suppress them (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"show"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By default, iOS does not display notification banners when the app is in the foreground.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Enable this to show system notification alerts even when the app is active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure based on app type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationConfigManager {","","    func configureForAppType(_ appType: AppType) {","        switch appType {","        case .messaging:","            \/\/ Messaging apps typically handle notifications in-app","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        case .ecommerce, .news:","            \/\/ E-commerce and news apps benefit from showing all notifications","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(true)","","        case .game:","            \/\/ Games might want to suppress during gameplay","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","        }","    }","","    func temporarilyDisableForegroundAlerts(during action: () -> Void) {","        let wasEnabled = Pushwoosh.configure.getShowPushnotificationAlert()","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        action()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(wasEnabled)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and use "},{"code":"Pushwoosh.ForegroundPush","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets whether to show alert for push notifications when app is in foreground.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setShowPushnotificationAlert:"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setshowpushnotificationalert:"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setShowPushnotificationAlert:","title":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"}]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setShowPushnotificationAlert:":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setshowpushnotificationalert:","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets whether to show alert for push notifications when app is in for